#HELPS
1 ARANO PLANTATION~
Arano Plantation is a quiet Hlaalu estate amid these fertile Ascadian lowlands
west of Suran with cultivated fields surrounding a modest manor and farmstead.
Unlike other plantations, its fields employ free labor instead of bound slaves
though a servant's secret loyalty disturbs its quiet order.~
